WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.840
"This is what we're going to do now.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.100
We are going to Valencia, so this is what
this episode is about."

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.900
"The best way to get to know Valencia is by
bike.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.420
We found a rental in the center and started
our exploration right away."

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.599
"So we've come to the Mercado Central..."

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.560
... to start our discovery of Valencia."

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.720
"Hmm, Greg is in Heaven right now."

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.400
"Jamones."

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:52.060
"We've come to the heart of the city.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.780
It's Plaza de la Reina and la Catedral."

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.920
"So we've come to the Horchateria Santa Catalina
to try horchata, which is a typical Valencia drink.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:14.300
It's so sweet."

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:26.179
"The next one on our list is the Jardines
del Turia which used to be a river, but is

00:01:26.179 --> 00:01:27.560
now a giant park."

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:31.070
"Where people run, ride bikes, work out, whatever."

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:35.720
"And it runs all the way down from the city
to the coast."

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.420
"To the beach."

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:38.380
"And this is where we are going next."

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:51.719
"After half an hour of cycling, we've made
it to Playa de las Serena which is a really

00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:53.100
white beach here in Valencia.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.500
A good spot to hang out and get some sun."

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.740
"When in Valencia, of course you need to eat
..."

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.580
"...the typical paella."

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:26.160
"So the last one on our list is la Ciudad de
las Artes."

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.220
"And this is where we are going to watch the
sun set."

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.420
"That's it from Valencia.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.279
Hasta luego."

